{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S09把“难受时想有人陪”收窄成“怕孤单到连那些气也肯再受”，比X更替人物下判断，削弱了一点原本的复杂和开放。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键落点，再让感受随音乐进程出现，观众更容易扫到重点，也更容易把人物经历与音乐变化对应起来。尤其是从舍不得、想念、孤独、动摇到重新站稳的过程，Y把心理转折和音乐细节交织得更具体，前后也更像一件持续发展的事。它偶尔有解释过满的问题，但整体上比X更容易让普通观众既听懂人物，又感受到音乐中的细微变化。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ab26a064-8a67-4bb2-8f22-c0c1f87d68f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T164431066144Z", "elapsed_seconds": 67.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:45:38.091874+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "501e688b94c1f5b1cf6d2a36aa6f399cd2f304b676f0af010d4d2e5fc297c858", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen